{"id":13435,"title":"体渲染 (Volume Rendering)与光线投射 (Ray Casting)算法详解","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/Aaron9489/article/details/127899392","final_url":"http://web.archive.org/web/20250108162303/https://blog.csdn.net/Aaron9489/article/details/127899392","year":null,"kind":"web","source":"ddg","doi":null,"arxiv":null,"sha256":null,"ctype":null,"text_src":"wayback","fetched_at":1792993072.655053,"text_chars":5898,"abstract":"CSDN博客\n\nhttps://blog.csdn.net › Aaron9489 › article › details › 127899392\n\n体渲染 (Volume Rendering)与光线投射 (Ray Casting)算法详解\n文章浏览阅读1.4w次，点赞22次，收藏71次。本文介绍了体渲染和RayCasting技术的基础知识，对比了体渲染与传统光栅化渲染的不同之处。体渲染利用体素（Voxel）对3D数据场进行建模，并通过光线投射算法实现高质量的渲染效果，适用于云雾、CT等非实体场数据的表现。","file":null,"marks":["unofficial"],"links":["http://web.archive.org/web/20250108162303/https://blog.csdn.net/Aaron9489/article/details/127899392","https://blog.csdn.net/Aaron9489/article/details/127899392"],"cited_by":[{"path":"2350-chunk-border-neighbor-access.md","name":"Chunk Border Neighbor Access","k":13},{"path":"2350-volume-ray-casting.md","name":"Volume Ray Casting","k":13}]}